## Aero chips

Glossy Aero pills: a deep border that is darker at the top, the color melting into a light tint toward the bottom, a rounded white shine across the top and a soft shadow underneath. Written `++color+text++`, in 16 colors (the 13 Annotate colors plus white, fog and black):

* `++R+text++` ++R+red++
* `++O+text++` ++O+orange++
* `++GL+text++` ++GL+gold++
