Chips made like the Radii Office app icons: a softly rounded tile, solid color through its top third fading to a bright tint, under a wide white gloss with a curved lower edge. Written `;;color;text;;`, in 16 colors (the 13 Annotate colors plus white, fog and black):

* `;;R;text;;` ;;R;red;;
