* `~CC~label~CC~` Counter badge: ~CC~Demo~CC~
* `~LK~label~LK~` Security latch: ~LK~Demo~LK~
* `~PR~label~PR~` Playback ribbon: ~PR~Demo~PR~
* `~CR~label~CR~` CPU gauge: ~CR~Demo~CR~
* `~SI~label~SI~` Stepper mesh: ~SI~Demo~SI~
* `~ORB~label~ORB~` Hydro orb (blue): ~ORB~Demo~ORB~
* `~SLS~label~SLS~` Lock slider: ~SLS~Demo~SLS~
* `~VM~label~VM~` Gadget clock: ~VM~Demo~VM~
* `~MT~label~MT~` Metal trigger: ~MT~Demo~MT~
