## Marketplace packs

The Marketplace in Writeout and Bitbook adds packs of extra styles. Once a pack is installed, its tags work just like the ones above. OpenDB shows every pack, so here they all are:

### Outline Glow Pack

Six transparent chips with neon outline glows. Clean on any background.

* `~OL~text~OL~` Outline Cyan: ~OL~Outline Cyan~OL~
* `~OLM~text~OLM~` Outline Magenta: ~OLM~Outline Magenta~OLM~
* `~OLV~text~OLV~` Outline Violet: ~OLV~Outline Violet~OLV~
* `~OLE~text~OLE~` Outline Emerald: ~OLE~Outline Emerald~OLE~
* `~OLA~text~OLA~` Outline Amber: ~OLA~Outline Amber~OLA~
* `~OLR~text~OLR~` Outline Rose: ~OLR~Outline Rose~OLR~

### Keydown Mega Pack

Fifteen brand-new Keydown styles in one install! Gels, neons, stickers, keycaps and more — use the toolbar chips, the style picker, or type any trigger code!

* `~SUN~text~SUN~` Sunset Gel: ~SUN~Sunset Gel~SUN~
* `~FOAM~text~FOAM~` Ocean Foam: ~FOAM~Ocean Foam~FOAM~
